{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Nd96yhFv5U9ZqSPCdbiNWM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始3-claim framing完全成立。Claim 1以voting AUROC 0.73 vs logprob 0.56为headline，SJ作为generalizable complement。\n  Claim 2 (correlation-selection gap) 定位为paper最具practical insight的发现——改变practitioners对structured TTS的认知。\n  Claim 3提供explanatory depth。Claims无需调整强度。Quality estimation framing被接受为first-class contribution，\n  correlation-selection gap被视为novel conceptual contribution。2×2 matrix + 3-seed robustness被认为generalization充分。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"baseline_logprob\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-012\"\n    description: \"Compute sequence log-probability for all existing pilot samples (SciERC NER+RE). Correlate log-prob with F1 (ρ, AUROC, τ). Make-or-break: SJ must beat log-prob.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_full_rho_sj: 0.357\n      ner_full_rho_fk: 0.265\n      ner_full_rho_logprob: 0.140\n      ner_full_rho_greedy_logprob: 0.162\n      ner_full_tau_sj: 0.266\n      ner_full_tau_logprob: 0.101\n      ner_full_auroc_sj: 0.689\n      ner_full_auroc_fk: 0.629\n      ner_full_auroc_logprob: 0.591\n      ner_full_n: 529\n      ner_sj_vs_logprob_rho_delta: 0.217\n      ner_sj_vs_logprob_auroc_delta: 0.098\n      re_full_rho_sj: 0.211\n      re_full_rho_fk: 0.253\n      re_full_rho_logprob: 0.247\n      re_full_auroc_sj: 0.592\n      re_full_auroc_fk: 0.626\n      re_full_auroc_logprob: 0.619\n      re_full_n: 397\n      re_cond_rho_sj: 0.368\n      re_cond_rho_fk: 0.317\n      re_cond_rho_logprob: 0.146\n      re_cond_auroc_sj: 0.684\n      re_cond_auroc_logprob: 0.549\n      re_cond_n: 296\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下SJ在NER上以rho +0.217的决定性优势碾压logprob，AUROC差距约+0.10在focal range内（0.10-0.17），\n      确立structural consistency的核心价值。logprob在NER上信号极弱（rho=0.14）是因为fine-tuned模型对NER\n      已充分校准，生成概率无法区分细粒度entity-set质量差异。RE full上logprob略优于SJ（0.247 vs 0.211）\n      不构成问题——反而为Claim 2提供素材：logprob作为per-sample信号在RE上有unique value，而SJ在RE \n      conditional set上以rho=0.368大幅反超logprob 0.146，说明剔除knowledge-gap实例后structural信号恢复。\n      此模式直接支撑correlation-selection gap论点。Reviewer认为NER上SJ vs logprob的差距足够decisive，\n      且logprob在RE conditional的崩溃（0.146）说明它不是万能信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Instance-Level Quality Estimation (SciERC, N=8, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER τ, NER AUROC, RE ρ, RE AUROC, RE_cond ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ, 0.357, 0.266, 0.689, 0.211, 0.592, 0.368]\n          - [FK, 0.265, 0.203, 0.629, 0.253, 0.626, 0.317]\n          - [Logprob, 0.140, 0.101, 0.591, 0.247, 0.619, 0.146]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart comparing AUROC across 3 signals (SJ/FK/logprob) for NER full / RE full / RE cond, highlighting SJ dominance on NER and RE cond\"\n    analysis: >\n      SJ在NER上的AUROC=0.689远超logprob 0.591，差距0.098在best档focal range下限附近。\n      关键在于RE conditional的翻转模式（SJ 0.368 >> logprob 0.146），这为后续correlation-selection gap\n      和task-complexity boundary分析奠定基础。Reviewer认为此对比充分证明structural信号的独立价值，\n      无需依赖selection improvement。\n\n  - name: \"baseline_exact_match\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-013\"\n    description: \"Exact-match voting rate: fraction of N samples producing identical entity/relation sets. Direct analogue of Wang et al. self-consistency.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_full_rho: 0.294\n      ner_full_p: 5.12e-12\n      ner_full_tau: 0.218\n      ner_full_auroc: 0.640\n      re_full_rho: 0.156\n      re_full_p: 0.0018\n      re_full_tau: 0.119\n      re_full_auroc: 0.586\n    result_rationale: >\n      EM作为原始self-consistency（Wang et al. 2023）在structured outputs上的直接类比，\n      预期表现中等：NER rho=0.294介于SJ（0.357）和FK（0.265）之间，RE更弱（0.156）。\n      best档下这个结果完美服务于叙事——EM太粗粒度，无法区分\"几乎正确\"和\"完全错误\"的entity set，\n      因为structured outputs的partial overlap比reasoning的discrete answer空间大得多。\n      这motivate了SJ这类set-aware similarity metric的必要性。Reviewer认为EM baseline充分，\n      证明简单迁移reasoning self-consistency到structured prediction是insufficient的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (EM row)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER τ, NER AUROC, RE ρ, RE AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [EM, 0.294, 0.218, 0.640, 0.156, 0.586]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      EM在NER上显著优于random但显著弱于SJ，验证了original self-consistency对structured output的局限性。\n      RE上EM几乎无效（rho=0.156），因为relation triplet的exact match概率极低。\n      best档reviewer将此视为支持SJ设计动机的positive evidence。\n\n  - name: \"baseline_entity_voting\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: \"Entity-level majority voting: count how many of N samples include each entity. Voting confidence as quality estimator.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_full_rho: 0.392\n      ner_full_p: 8.1e-21\n      ner_full_tau: 0.291\n      ner_full_auroc: 0.704\n      re_full_rho: 0.340\n      re_full_p: 3.21e-12\n      re_full_tau: 0.256\n      re_full_auroc: 0.667\n      ner_voting_f1: 0.625\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.648\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.779\n      re_voting_f1: 0.358\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.402\n      re_oracle_f1: 0.589\n    result_rationale: >\n      Voting confidence成为NER上最强单一信号（rho=0.392, AUROC=0.704），略优于SJ（0.357, 0.689）。\n      best档下这不构成对SJ的威胁，反而强化叙事：voting和SJ同属structural consistency family，\n      两者都利用entity-across-sample一致性。Voting更简单（直接计数），SJ更通用（可扩展到任意结构化输出）。\n      关键负面结果：voting作为selection策略（选majority entity构成的答案）F1=0.625 < greedy 0.648。\n      这是correlation-selection gap的首个信号——即使instance-level估计强（AUROC 0.704），\n      也不能直接转化为per-sample selection。best档reviewer将voting+SJ视为互补的structural family成员，\n      而非竞争关系。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (Voting row) + Table 3: Selection F1\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, AUROC, Selection_F1, vs_Greedy]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting, 0.392, 0.704, 0.625, \"-0.023\"]\n          - [SJ, 0.357, 0.689, \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Voting confidence scatter plot: voting_conf vs instance F1, showing strong positive trend but with high variance at intermediate confidence levels\"\n    analysis: >\n      Voting confidence AUROC=0.704最高，但voting selection F1=0.625 < greedy 0.648的结果是\n      correlation-selection gap的核心evidence。best档reviewer理解这个区别：instance-level质量预测\n      能力不等于per-sample选择能力，因为voting_conf是跨sample的aggregate signal，无法rank同一instance的N个sample。\n\n  - name: \"evaluation_metrics_expansion\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-015\"\n    description: \"Unified 5-signal evaluation with AUROC, τ, ρ, calibration, leave-one-out SJ. All signals × all datasets.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_n_valid: 529\n      ner_n_cond: 501\n      ner_voting_rho_full: 0.502\n      ner_voting_rho_cond: 0.450\n      ner_voting_auroc: 0.728\n      ner_voting_tau: 0.377\n      ner_sj_rho_full: 0.357\n      ner_sj_rho_cond: 0.412\n      ner_sj_auroc: 0.666\n      ner_sj_tau: 0.266\n      ner_em_rho_full: 0.257\n      ner_em_auroc: 0.623\n      ner_fk_rho_full: 0.265\n      ner_fk_auroc: 0.624\n      ner_logprob_rho_full: 0.140\n      ner_logprob_auroc: 0.559\n      re_voting_rho_full: 0.422\n      re_voting_auroc: 0.716\n      re_sj_rho_full: 0.211\n      re_sj_auroc: 0.582\n      re_logprob_rho_full: 0.247\n      re_logprob_auroc: 0.635\n      loo_sj_max_delta_rho: 0.000305\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下统一评估框架确立信号排序的稳健性。NER full ordering: voting(0.502) > SJ(0.357) > FK(0.265) > EM(0.257) > logprob(0.140)，\n      三个独立指标（ρ/τ/AUROC）排序完全一致，消除单一指标cherry-picking的reviewer疑虑。\n      SJ在NER cond上反超voting之外的所有信号（0.412 vs FK 0.306, EM 0.343），说明SJ对\"模型有能力但不确定\"的实例\n      有独特判别力。LOO-SJ与原始SJ差异仅0.0003，彻底消除evaluation circularity质疑。\n      Reviewer认为多指标一致性证明findings robust，LOO check是methodological contribution。\n      Cross-dataset结果（CoNLL AUROC 0.80, LLaMA NER AUROC 0.70+）在later exp-002/007中确认，\n      使structural > logprob rate跨全部NER配置达100%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Unified Quality Estimation (SciERC, N=8, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER_ρ, NER_τ, NER_AUROC, RE_ρ, RE_AUROC, NER_cond_ρ, RE_cond_ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting, 0.502, 0.377, 0.728, 0.422, 0.716, 0.450, 0.463]\n          - [SJ, 0.357, 0.266, 0.666, 0.211, 0.582, 0.412, 0.368]\n          - [FK, 0.265, 0.203, 0.624, 0.253, 0.631, 0.306, 0.317]\n          - [EM, 0.257, 0.192, 0.623, 0.100, 0.504, 0.343, 0.361]\n          - [Logprob, 0.140, 0.101, 0.559, 0.247, 0.635, 0.163, 0.146]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Reliability diagram (calibration): 5 signals × NER/RE, showing ECE values and calibration curves\"\n      - \"Multi-metric consistency heatmap: ρ vs τ vs AUROC rankings across signals and settings\"\n    analysis: >\n      5-signal unified evaluation是paper的empirical backbone。best档reviewer看到三个metric方向一致、\n      LOO无circularity、structural family跨NER一致领先，认为evaluation methodology sound。\n      SJ在cond set上的relative strength（超越FK和EM）说明它在\"中间难度\"实例上最有价值——\n      这些正是selective prediction最需要信号的区间。\n\n  - name: \"ner_n16_scierc\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: \"NER N=16 on SciERC with 3 seeds for robustness. Test N-scaling effect.\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_instances: 551\n      ner_n: 529\n      re_n: 397\n      N: 16\n      T: 1.0\n      seed42_ner_sj_rho: 0.398\n      seed42_ner_voting_conf_rho: 0.399\n      seed42_ner_logprob_rho: 0.237\n      seed42_re_sj_rho: 0.277\n      seed42_re_voting_conf_rho: 0.380\n      seed123_ner_sj_rho: 0.424\n      seed123_ner_voting_conf_rho: 0.438\n      seed456_ner_sj_rho: 0.384\n      seed456_ner_voting_conf_rho: 0.411\n      ner_3seed_mean_sj_rho: 0.402\n      ner_3seed_sd_sj_rho: 0.020\n      ner_3seed_mean_voting_rho: 0.416\n      ner_3seed_sd_voting_rho: 0.020\n      n8_to_n16_ner_sj_delta: \"+0.016 to +0.068\"\n      re_3seed_mean_sj_rho: 0.273\n      re_3seed_sd_sj_rho: 0.010\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下N=16实验确认三个关键点：(1) 3-seed NER SJ rho均值0.402±0.020，SD极低，\n      证明结果非随机种子产物。(2) N=8→N=16 SJ rho提升+0.02~0.07，证明N-scaling有正效应\n      但saturating，与structural consistency作为aggregate statistic的理论一致。\n      (3) RE rho仍弱（~0.27），3-seed一致，确认task-complexity boundary是systematic而非noise。\n      Reviewer认为3-seed SD<0.03满足robustness标准，不需要更多种子。\n      N=16的marginal improvement小于N=8→greedy的基础gap，说明信号质量比sample数量更重要。\n      这为\"T=1.0 + N=8 sufficient\"的实践推荐提供依据。RE的persistent weakness被accepted\n      为Claim 3的supporting evidence——compound error使所有信号降级。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: 3-Seed Robustness (SciERC, N=16, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Seed, NER_SJ_ρ, NER_VC_ρ, NER_logprob_ρ, RE_SJ_ρ, RE_VC_ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [42, 0.398, 0.399, 0.237, 0.277, 0.380]\n          - [123, 0.424, 0.438, 0.239, 0.267, 0.370]\n          - [456, 0.384, 0.411, 0.232, 0.268, 0.375]\n          - [\"Mean±SD\", \"0.402±0.020\", \"0.416±0.020\", \"0.236±0.004\", \"0.271±0.006\", \"0.375±0.005\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Error bar plot: 3-seed mean ± SD for each signal on NER vs RE, visualizing stability and NER-RE gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      NER上structural信号跨seed高度稳定（SD≤0.02），logprob更稳定但绝对水平低得多。\n      RE上所有信号一致弱且稳定，排除了单seed-lucky的可能。best档reviewer认为2 models × 2 datasets × 3 seeds\n      的矩阵提供了sufficient generalization evidence。\n\n  - name: \"ner_conll2003\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: \"Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on CoNLL-2003 + NER N=8 inference. Cross-dataset generalization.\"\n    expected_results:\n      dataset: CoNLL-2003\n      model: Qwen3-8B\n      n_instances: 3453\n      n_valid: 2756\n      N: 8\n      T: 1.0\n      greedy_f1: 0.912\n      oracle_f1: 0.954\n      oracle_headroom: 0.042\n      sj_rho_full: 0.436\n      sj_tau_full: 0.385\n      sj_auroc_full: 0.801\n      fk_rho_full: 0.400\n      fk_auroc_full: 0.774\n      logprob_rho_full: 0.316\n      logprob_auroc_full: 0.753\n      em_rho_full: 0.451\n      em_auroc_full: 0.816\n      voting_conf_rho_full: 0.424\n      voting_conf_auroc_full: 0.789\n      sj_vs_logprob_delta_rho: 0.120\n      sj_vs_logprob_ci_significant: true\n      voting_f1: 0.914\n    result_rationale: >\n      CoNLL-2003是标准NER benchmark，模型greedy F1高达0.912（vs SciERC 0.618），oracle headroom仅0.042。\n      best档下这个\"easy dataset\"结果有三重价值：(1) SJ rho=0.436仍然显著优于logprob 0.316（delta=0.120, \n      bootstrap CI不含0），证明structural advantage不是dataset-specific artifact。(2) 所有结构信号\n      的AUROC大幅提升（SJ 0.80 vs SciERC 0.69），因为高accuracy regime下质量估计更容易——\n      这与Claim 3 task-complexity boundary方向一致。(3) EM在CoNLL上异常强（0.451, AUROC 0.816），\n      因为简单NER的entity set更容易exact match，但这只说明EM适合easy tasks，而SJ在hard tasks上优势更大。\n      Oracle headroom仅4.2pp说明NER few-shot已接近天花板，selection改进空间极小，\n      进一步支持\"quality estimation比selection更有实际价值\"的framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Cross-Dataset Generalization (CoNLL-2003, Qwen3-8B, N=8)\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ, τ, AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ, 0.436, 0.385, 0.801]\n          - [FK, 0.400, 0.357, 0.774]\n          - [EM, 0.451, 0.400, 0.816]\n          - [Voting, 0.424, 0.378, 0.789]\n          - [Logprob, 0.316, 0.247, 0.753]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: SciERC vs CoNLL AUROC comparison for each signal, showing consistent structural > logprob pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      CoNLL上SJ AUROC 0.80是全实验最高，强化cross-dataset generalization。EM在easy dataset上反超SJ\n      不影响叙事，因为(a) SJ仍然beat logprob，(b) EM无法推广到RE/event等非entity任务。\n      Reviewer认为SciERC(hard)+CoNLL(easy)的覆盖足够，加上LLaMA验证构成2×2 matrix。\n\n  - name: \"ner_wnut17\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: \"WNUT-17 social media NER. Expected negative — noisy domain stress test.\"\n    expected_results:\n      dataset: WNUT-17\n      model: Qwen3-8B\n      n_instances: 1287\n      n_gold_empty: 598\n      N: 16\n      T: 1.0\n      greedy_f1: 0.523\n      oracle_f1: 0.664\n      headroom: 0.141\n      rho_sj_full: 0.082\n      rho_fk_full: 0.124\n      rho_logprob_full: -0.414\n      rho_sj_cond: 0.275\n      rho_fk_cond: 0.164\n      rho_logprob_cond: 0.352\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 53.7\n      status: orphaned\n    result_rationale: >\n      WNUT-17预期且确认为negative：>50% samples F1=0说明模型对social media domain能力不足，\n      54%的gold empty instances进一步扭曲分布。SJ rho_full仅0.082（not significant），\n      logprob甚至负相关（-0.414，因为模型对不熟悉的domain overconfident）。\n      best档下此结果被orphaned但不浪费——它为Claim 3提供boundary evidence：当模型base capability不足时\n      （greedy F1仅0.523），所有consistency信号都失效。这与Claim 3的\"capability range\"概念一致。\n      Reviewer不会质疑为什么不include WNUT，因为paper已有2 NER datasets + 2 models = 4 configs，\n      WNUT在Limitations中简要提及作为\"informal text domain remains open challenge\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Orphaned但有分析价值。logprob负相关是striking finding——可在Claim 3讨论中作为\n      \"模型校准在OOD域崩溃\"的evidence一句话提及。不单独成table/figure。\n\n  - name: \"re_diagnostic_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: \"Per-relation-type consistency breakdown, error propagation analysis, bootstrap CI, threshold sensitivity.\"\n    expected_results:\n      per_relation_rho_range: \"FEATURE-OF ρ≈0.004 (worst) to HYPONYM-OF ρ≈0.545 (best)\"\n      feature_of_rho_sj: 0.004\n      feature_of_n: 50\n      feature_of_mean_f1: 0.254\n      hyponym_of_rho_sj: 0.545\n      hyponym_of_n: 36\n      conjunction_rho_vc: 0.484\n      used_for_rho_vc: 0.286\n      error_propagation_tail_pct: 21.9\n      error_propagation_head_pct: 17.7\n      error_propagation_head_tail_pct: 15.9\n      error_propagation_type_pct: 8.3\n      span_errors_total_pct: 55.5\n      bootstrap_ci_ner_sj: [0.295, 0.459]\n      bootstrap_ci_re_sj: [0.142, 0.339]\n      fisher_z_ner_vs_re_sj_p: 0.021\n      fisher_z_ner_vs_re_sj_significant: true\n      threshold_sensitivity_thr0_rho_sj: 0.316\n      threshold_sensitivity_thr0_n: 313\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RE diagnostic提供Claim 3的核心mechanistic evidence。FEATURE-OF rho≈0跨所有信号\n      说明某些relation types对模型而言fundamentally intractable（F1=0.254），而非SJ的问题。\n      Entity span errors占RE FN的55.5%说明error propagation的主因是upstream NER错误，\n      非relation classification本身。Fisher z检验p=0.021确认NER-RE rho差异统计显著。\n      Bootstrap CI不含0确认所有rho estimates reliable。Threshold sensitivity分析显示conditional\n      filtering（排除F1=0实例）稳定提升rho但对阈值选择不过度敏感。\n      Reviewer认为this diagnostic depth将本文从\"SJ works/doesn't work\"提升到\"我们理解为什么\"，\n      是从empirical paper到analytical contribution的关键升级。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Per-Relation-Type Consistency (SciERC RE)\"\n        columns: [Relation, n, Mean_F1, ρ_SJ, ρ_FK, ρ_VC]\n        rows:\n          - [HYPONYM-OF, 36, 0.513, 0.545, 0.646, 0.628]\n          - [CONJUNCTION, 86, 0.480, 0.383, 0.350, 0.484]\n          - [USED-FOR, 299, 0.422, 0.236, 0.255, 0.286]\n          - [PART-OF, 44, 0.297, 0.239, 0.348, 0.283]\n          - [EVALUATE-FOR, 62, 0.365, 0.172, 0.255, 0.226]\n          - [COMPARE, 35, 0.453, 0.168, 0.184, 0.180]\n          - [FEATURE-OF, 50, 0.254, 0.004, 0.052, 0.014]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Error propagation Sankey diagram: RE FN breakdown by error type (head/tail/type/combined)\"\n      - \"Scatter: per-relation mean_F1 vs rho_sj, showing positive correlation with FEATURE-OF as outlier\"\n    analysis: >\n      FEATURE-OF的near-zero rho跨所有信号是强evidence：问题不在SJ而在task本身。\n      Span error占55.5% FN直接支撑compound error propagation narrative。\n      best档reviewer视此分析为paper的analytical contribution之一——不仅报告what works，\n      还解释why with mechanistic granularity。\n\n  - name: \"temperature_sensitivity_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: \"T=0.7 vs T=1.0 comparison on NER+RE for all signals. Signal-noise tradeoff.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_sj_rho_t10: 0.383\n      ner_sj_rho_t07: 0.388\n      ner_sj_delta: 0.005\n      ner_fk_rho_t10: 0.259\n      ner_fk_rho_t07: 0.321\n      ner_fk_delta: 0.062\n      re_sj_rho_t10: 0.244\n      re_sj_rho_t07: 0.234\n      re_sj_delta: -0.010\n      sj_temperature_robustness: \"Δρ=±0.01\"\n      fk_temperature_sensitivity: \"Δρ=±0.06-0.09\"\n      oracle_headroom_t10_re: 0.167\n      oracle_headroom_t07_re: 0.131\n      diversity_1_sj_t10: 0.389\n      diversity_1_sj_t07: 0.313\n      recommendation: \"T=1.0 + conditional filtering > temperature optimization\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下temperature分析揭示SJ的关键优势：温度鲁棒性。SJ Δρ=±0.01说明SJ对sampling \n      temperature几乎不敏感，而FK在T=0.7和T=1.0之间变化高达Δρ=±0.06-0.09。\n      这是因为SJ度量entity-set级别的结构相似性，对surface text变异（temperature控制的主要效应）\n      天然不敏感。T=1.0保留更多oracle headroom（RE: 0.167 vs 0.131）和diversity（1-SJ: 0.389 vs 0.313），\n      说明higher temperature虽然引入更多noise但也保留更多potential for improvement。\n      这为\"T=1.0 + conditional filtering\"的实践推荐提供依据：与其精调temperature，不如用structural \n      signal做post-hoc filtering。best档reviewer认为temperature robustness是SJ的practical advantage，\n      降低practitioners的hyperparameter tuning burden。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Temperature Sensitivity (SciERC, N=8)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER_ρ_T07, NER_ρ_T10, Δ, RE_ρ_T07, RE_ρ_T10, Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ, 0.388, 0.383, \"+0.005\", 0.234, 0.244, \"-0.010\"]\n          - [FK, 0.321, 0.259, \"+0.062\", 0.184, 0.278, \"-0.094\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: ρ vs temperature for each signal, showing SJ flat line vs FK's temperature dependence\"\n    analysis: >\n      SJ的temperature robustness (Δρ≤0.01) vs FK的sensitivity (Δρ≈0.06-0.09)是paper的practical insight。\n      Conditional filtering >> temperature tuning的finding简化了practitioners的决策——\n      不需要搜索最优temperature，用T=1.0+SJ filtering即可。\n\n  - name: \"adaptive_compute_demo\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: \"Best-of-N selection across all datasets: SJ vs logprob vs FK vs EM vs voting vs random vs greedy.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_scierc_s42_greedy: 0.618\n      ner_scierc_s42_oracle: 0.787\n      ner_scierc_s42_sj: 0.620\n      ner_scierc_s42_logprob: 0.621\n      ner_scierc_s42_fk: 0.621\n      ner_scierc_s42_em: 0.606\n      ner_scierc_s42_voting: 0.585\n      ner_scierc_s42_random: 0.586\n      ner_conll_greedy: 0.725\n      ner_conll_oracle: 0.757\n      ner_conll_sj: 0.718\n      ner_conll_logprob: 0.716\n      re_scierc_greedy: 0.403\n      re_scierc_oracle: 0.631\n      re_scierc_logprob: 0.410\n      re_scierc_sj: 0.397\n      re_scierc_voting: 0.408\n      re_scierc_random: 0.364\n      ner_any_signal_beats_greedy: false\n      re_logprob_beats_greedy: true\n      re_logprob_vs_greedy_delta: \"+0.007 to +0.024\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下这是Claim 2 correlation-selection gap的决定性evidence。NER上所有信号均未超greedy：\n      SJ 0.620 ≈ logprob 0.621 ≈ FK 0.621 ≈ greedy 0.618（差异在noise范围内），而oracle 0.787\n      说明headroom巨大（+16.9pp）但当前信号无法exploit。RE上唯一logprob以+2.4pp超greedy，\n      其他信号均失败。best档reviewer理解这个negative result的novelty：(1)它推翻了从reasoning \n      self-consistency类推到structured prediction的naive expectation，(2)它精确定位了gap的来源——\n      consistency signals是instance-level aggregates（一个score per input），不能rank同一instance的\n      N个outputs，而logprob是唯一的per-sample signal。(3) oracle headroom的存在证明information\n      exists in the samples，只是当前unsupervised信号无法access它。\n      CoNLL上NER所有信号均弱于greedy（0.714-0.718 vs 0.725），因为easy task的oracle headroom仅3.2pp，\n      greedy已接近最优。这进一步支持\"NER quality estimation > selection\"的framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Best-of-N Selection F1\"\n        columns: [Config, Greedy, Oracle, SJ, Logprob, FK, Voting, Random]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NER SciERC\", 0.618, 0.787, 0.620, 0.621, 0.621, 0.585, 0.586]\n          - [\"NER CoNLL\", 0.725, 0.757, 0.718, 0.716, 0.717, 0.714, 0.692]\n          - [\"RE SciERC\", 0.403, 0.631, 0.397, 0.410, 0.396, 0.408, 0.364]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1 (paper highlight): Selection F1 bar chart with greedy baseline line and oracle ceiling, showing ALL signals clustered near greedy on NER while oracle is far above — the visual gap IS the contribution\"\n    analysis: >\n      这张figure是paper最重要的可视化——greedy line、signal cluster、oracle ceiling之间的巨大空白区域\n      直观展示correlation-selection gap。best档reviewer被这个visualization convinced，\n      认为这是paper最novel的finding。RE logprob +2.4pp是唯一positive selection result，\n      对应logprob作为per-sample信号的unique property。\n\n  - name: \"ner_multi_model\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B on SciERC. Cross-model validation for model-agnostic claim.\"\n    expected_results:\n      model: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct\"\n      dataset: SciERC\n      N: 8\n      T: 1.0\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.660\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.781\n      ner_headroom: 0.121\n      ner_rho_sj: 0.363\n      ner_rho_fk: 0.327\n      ner_rho_logprob: 0.183\n      ner_structural_beats_surface: true\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.434\n      re_oracle_f1: 0.568\n      re_rho_sj: 0.299\n      re_rho_fk: 0.305\n      re_rho_logprob: 0.288\n      re_structural_beats_surface: false\n      re_cond_rho_sj: 0.405\n      re_cond_rho_logprob: 0.092\n      sample_f1_pct_zero_re: 41.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下LLaMA验证了findings的model-agnostic性。NER上SJ rho=0.363与Qwen的0.357几乎一致，\n      structural beats surface holds（SJ > FK > logprob），说明structural consistency advantage\n      不是Qwen architecture/training的artifact。LLaMA logprob在NER上更弱（0.183 vs Qwen 0.140），\n      可能因为LLaMA的logprob calibration不同。RE上SJ full rho=0.299依然弱，但RE cond上SJ=0.405\n      远超logprob 0.092，模式与Qwen完全一致。RE cond上logprob的崩溃（0.092）跨model一致，\n      强化Claim 2中\"logprob在conditional set失效\"的finding。\n      RE structural_beats_surface=false是expected——在RE full上FK和logprob略优于SJ，\n      但paper的claim是NER上structural beats logprob（100% configs），RE上用于diagnostic analysis。\n      3-seed LLaMA验证（seed 42/123/456）显示NER SJ rho SD~0.05，虽然比Qwen变异略大但方向一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Cross-Model Validation (LLaMA-3.1-8B, SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Subtask, SJ_ρ, FK_ρ, Logprob_ρ, Struct>Surface?]\n        rows:\n          - [NER full, 0.363, 0.327, 0.183, \"✓\"]\n          - [NER cond, 0.311, 0.226, 0.109, \"✓\"]\n          - [RE full, 0.299, 0.305, 0.288, \"✗\"]\n          - [RE cond, 0.405, 0.259, 0.092, \"✓\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Qwen vs LLaMA paired bar chart for NER rho: shows near-identical structural > logprob pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA结果是2×2 matrix的关键一角。NER上Qwen SJ=0.357, LLaMA SJ=0.363几乎不可区分，\n      而logprob差异更大（0.140 vs 0.183），说明structural signals比model-specific signals更stable across architectures。\n      best档reviewer认为2 models sufficient for model-agnostic claim at 8B scale level。\n\n  - name: \"re_n16_confirmation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: \"RE N=16 on SciERC to confirm negative finding with higher statistical power.\"\n    expected_results:\n      N: 16\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.434\n      re_oracle_f1: 0.666\n      re_headroom: 0.232\n      re_rho_sj_full: 0.297\n      re_rho_fk_full: 0.287\n      re_rho_logprob_full: 0.299\n      re_rho_sj_cond: 0.398\n      re_rho_fk_cond: 0.377\n      re_rho_logprob_cond: 0.275\n      ner_rho_sj_full: 0.377\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.664\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.821\n      ner_headroom: 0.157\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下N=16 RE确认了RE full rho的persistent weakness：SJ rho=0.297即使sample翻倍也未达0.40。\n      这排除了\"N=8 sample budget不够\"的alternative explanation——问题是compound error propagation\n      带来的fundamental noise floor。同时oracle headroom从N=8的0.167扩大到N=16的0.232，\n      说明更多samples确实提供更多diversity，但没有unsupervised signal能exploit。\n      NER上N=16 SJ rho=0.377略低于N=8的0.398，可能是random variation（在bootstrap CI内），\n      说明NER信号已在N=8 saturated。\n      Reviewer认为RE N=16 negative result不是weakness——它strengthens Claim 3 by ruling out\n      sample budget as the sole explanation for RE weakness。Problem is more fundamental than N。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4 (N=16 row)\"\n        columns: [Config, N, SJ_ρ, FK_ρ, Logprob_ρ, SJ_cond_ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [\"RE N=8\", 8, 0.211, 0.253, 0.247, 0.368]\n          - [\"RE N=16\", 16, 0.297, 0.287, 0.299, 0.398]\n          - [\"NER N=8\", 8, 0.357, 0.265, 0.140, 0.412]\n          - [\"NER N=16\", 16, 0.377, 0.251, 0.315, 0.360]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 RE结果是nuanced的：rho从0.211提升到0.297（+0.086），说明更多samples有帮助，\n      但未达到NER的水平。Cond set上RE N=16 SJ=0.398接近threshold，说明compound error的影响\n      可以被conditional filtering部分缓解。best档下这被视为Claim 3的refined evidence。\n\n  - name: \"capability_stratification\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: \"Stratify instances by difficulty (greedy F1, sentence length, entity count). Test inverted-U hypothesis.\"\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_sj_rho_overall: 0.398\n      ner_by_ent_count_0_sj_rho: 0.689\n      ner_by_ent_count_1_2_sj_rho: 0.415\n      ner_by_ent_count_3_5_sj_rho: 0.353\n      ner_by_ent_count_6plus_sj_rho: 0.547\n      ner_by_sent_len_Q1_sj_rho: 0.461\n      ner_by_sent_len_Q4_sj_rho: 0.382\n      re_by_greedy_f1_hard_sj_rho: -0.043\n      re_by_greedy_f1_easy_sj_rho: 0.210\n      proxy_independence_f1_vs_slen: -0.021\n      proxy_independence_f1_vs_ecnt: 0.007\n      inverted_u_confirmed: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下capability stratification提供了两个insights：(1) inverted-U pattern NOT confirmed——\n      SJ rho在independent proxies（sentence length, entity count）上没有呈现clean的先升后降模式，\n      而是较为平坦或单调。这是honest reporting，避免overclaiming。(2) 但entity count=0（无entity的句子）\n      上SJ rho=0.689异常高，说明\"空集\"的consistency极强（所有samples都predict nothing或全predict something）。\n      RE hard instances（greedy F1<0.25）上SJ rho=-0.043（无信号甚至轻微反向），vs easy上0.210，\n      支持\"模型能力范围之外consistency失效\"的narrative。\n      Reviewer认为honest reporting of non-confirmation是methodological strength，\n      不overclaim inverted-U但保留entity-count和difficulty-stratified分析的解释价值。\n      Independent proxy analysis（sentence length与F1相关性仅-0.021）证明stratification variable\n      不是F1的proxy，避免circular reasoning。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Stratified ρ by Entity Count (SciERC NER)\"\n        columns: [Entity_Count, n, SJ_ρ, FK_ρ, Logprob_ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0\", \"~40\", 0.689, 0.550, 0.400]\n          - [\"1-2\", \"~180\", 0.415, 0.310, 0.220]\n          - [\"3-5\", \"~220\", 0.353, 0.260, 0.170]\n          - [\"6+\", \"~90\", 0.547, 0.380, 0.280]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: signal ρ across entity_count × subtask (NER/RE), showing gradient from high to low\"\n    analysis: >\n      Entity count=0和6+的高rho形成U-shape（非inverted-U），可解释为：空集高consensus + \n      丰entity instances上structural signals有更多\"evidence\"用于比较。\n      RE hard上的near-zero/negative rho是Claim 3的strongest evidence point。\n\n  - name: \"selection_curves\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-010\"\n    description: \"Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16. Visualization for paper figures.\"\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_greedy: 0.618\n      scierc_ner_n4_sj: 0.607\n      scierc_ner_n4_logprob: 0.616\n      scierc_ner_n8_sj: 0.614\n      scierc_ner_n8_logprob: 0.619\n      scierc_ner_n16_sj: 0.620\n      scierc_ner_n16_logprob: 0.621\n      scierc_ner_n16_oracle: 0.787\n      scierc_re_greedy: 0.403\n      scierc_re_n8_logprob: 0.413\n      scierc_re_n16_logprob: 0.410\n      scierc_re_n16_oracle: 0.631\n      conll_ner_greedy: 0.725\n      conll_ner_n8_sj: 0.718\n      conll_ner_n8_oracle: 0.757\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下selection curves的核心价值在可视化——figure展示所有信号的F1曲线随N增长几乎平坦\n      （紧贴greedy baseline），而oracle曲线陡升。NER上N=4→8→16的SJ selection F1仅从0.607→0.614→0.620，\n      vs oracle从0.714→0.752→0.787。这个visual gap是paper最有冲击力的figure。\n      RE上logprob曲线微升（到0.413 at N=8），是唯一visible improvement。\n      CoNLL上所有曲线都在更高F1区间但同样flat（signals 0.714-0.718 vs oracle 0.757）。\n      Reviewer认为这张图比任何table都更直观地传达correlation-selection gap——\n      \"the whitespace between signal lines and oracle IS the gap\"。\n      此figure directly addresses R16 (\"zero figures\")。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: Selection curves — F1 vs N for each signal + oracle ceiling + greedy baseline. Three panels: SciERC NER, SciERC RE, CoNLL NER. Signal lines flat near greedy, oracle rises — visual gap is the contribution\"\n      - \"Inset annotation: oracle headroom percentage at N=16 (NER +16.9pp, RE +22.8pp) vs best signal improvement (NER +0.3pp, RE +0.7pp)\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是paper必须有的figure，直接回应R16。best档reviewer被visual gap convinced，\n      认为一图胜千言——不需要读table就能理解correlation-selection gap的magnitude。\n      Oracle的steep rise vs signals的flat lines是non-trivial finding，因为naive expectation\n      是\"more samples + better ranking = better output\"。\n\n  - name: \"ner_ood_robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-011\"\n    description: \"OOD robustness: test NER consistency signal on cross-domain transfer.\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"planned (not executed)\"\n      hypothetical_ner_ood_sj_rho: 0.15-0.25\n      hypothetical_fk_rho: 0.10-0.18\n      hypothetical_logprob_rho: 0.05-0.15\n      structural_still_beats_surface: true\n      absolute_performance_degraded: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下exp-011未执行，因为(1)依赖已orphaned的exp-003 WNUT数据，(2) priority P2且\n      paper已有2 datasets × 2 models = 4 NER configs的sufficient coverage。\n      如果执行，预期OOD domain上所有信号大幅退化但structural仍优于surface——\n      因为OOD下entity set的partial overlap仍比exact match更informative。\n      Logprob在OOD上可能overconfident（如WNUT所示负相关），使structural advantage更大。\n      best档reviewer不会因缺少此实验扣分——paper在Limitations中承认\"informal text domains \n      not covered\"已sufficient。OOD robustness是natural future work方向。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Not executed, acknowledged in Limitations. best档下此gap不影响acceptance，\n      因为2×2 matrix + 3-seed在formal text domains（scientific + news）上已sufficient。\n      OOD robustness与Claim 3的boundary condition narrative一致——\n      可在Discussion中hypothesize模型capability不足时所有signals degrade。\n\n  - name: \"signal_ensemble_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-016\"\n    description: \"SJ+logprob ensemble: correlation analysis, grid search linear combination, logistic regression, best-of-N selection.\"\n    expected_results:\n      sj_logprob_pearson_ner: 0.57\n      sj_logprob_pearson_re: 0.42\n      best_linear_ner_combo: \"SJ+voting_conf\"\n      best_linear_ner_alpha: 0.3\n      best_linear_ner_rho: 0.489\n      best_linear_re_combo: \"voting_conf+logprob\"\n      best_linear_re_alpha: 0.6\n      best_linear_re_rho: 0.429\n      ensemble_ner_auroc: 0.735\n      ensemble_re_auroc: 0.719\n      best_single_ner_auroc: 0.700\n      best_single_re_auroc: 0.721\n      ensemble_ner_auroc_delta: \"+0.035\"\n      ensemble_re_auroc_delta: \"-0.002\"\n      fk_logistic_coefficient: \"negative\"\n      selection_f1_ner_greedy: 0.609\n      selection_f1_ner_logprob: 0.609\n      selection_f1_ner_ensemble: 0.604\n      selection_f1_ner_oracle: 0.769\n      selection_f1_re_logprob: 0.397\n      selection_f1_re_greedy: 0.374\n      selection_f1_re_ensemble: 0.367\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下ensemble分析回应了Dream 2两位reviewer的independent flag（R11）。\n      SJ和logprob的Pearson correlation 0.57（NER）说明两者partially redundant但非identical——\n      structural consistency和model confidence捕捉不同维度的quality information。\n      最优linear组合是SJ+voting_conf（α=0.3）而非SJ+logprob，说明structural family内部互补\n      优于structural+model-confidence组合。NER ensemble AUROC=0.735比best single 0.700提升+3.5pp，\n      但RE上ensemble无改进（0.719 vs 0.721），因为RE上信号本身太弱，组合也无法rescue。\n      FK在logistic regression中系数为负——surface agreement在structural+model signals存在时\n      是net-negative，可能因为FK的noise（对token-level variation过度敏感）干扰了其他信号。\n      Selection F1上ensemble仍然不超greedy（NER 0.604 < 0.609），再次确认correlation-selection gap。\n      Reviewer认为ensemble分析thorough且conclusions honest：ensemble有marginal value for quality estimation\n      但不改变selection picture。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Ensemble Analysis\"\n        columns: [Method, NER_ρ, NER_AUROC, RE_ρ, RE_AUROC, NER_Sel_F1]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Best single (voting)\", 0.502, 0.700, 0.422, 0.721, 0.596]\n          - [\"SJ+VC α=0.3\", 0.489, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Logistic 5-signal\", \"—\", 0.735, \"—\", 0.719, 0.604]\n          - [\"Greedy\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", 0.609]\n          - [\"Oracle\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", 0.769]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: SJ vs logprob per-instance with Pearson r annotation, colored by F1 quartile — showing partial redundancy\"\n      - \"Alpha sweep line plot: ρ vs α for SJ+VC and SJ+logprob combinations on NER and RE\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ensemble的marginal-but-real improvement on NER quality estimation (+3.5pp AUROC)\n      和zero improvement on selection是best档的核心insight reprise。\n      FK negative coefficient是actionable finding——practitioners应drop FK when structural signals available。\n      SJ+VC > SJ+logprob说明structural family内部互补性强于cross-family组合。\n\n  - name: \"ner_llama_conll\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-017\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B on CoNLL-2003. Completes 2×2 matrix (Qwen×LLaMA × SciERC×CoNLL).\"\n    expected_results:\n      model: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\"\n      dataset: CoNLL-2003\n      N: 8\n      T: 1.0\n      n_instances: 3453\n      n_valid: 2756\n      greedy_f1: 0.927\n      oracle_f1: 0.944\n      oracle_headroom: 0.018\n      full_sj_rho: 0.431\n      full_fk_rho: 0.428\n      full_logprob_rho: 0.307\n      full_em_rho: 0.431\n      full_voting_conf_rho: 0.426\n      full_sj_auroc: 0.704\n      full_logprob_auroc: 0.761\n      cond_sj_rho: 0.436\n      cond_logprob_rho: 0.328\n      sj_vs_logprob_delta: 0.124\n      structural_beats_logprob_rho: true\n      n16_sj_rho: 0.464\n      n16_3seed_mean_sj_rho: 0.463\n      n16_3seed_sd_sj_rho: 0.007\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下LLaMA+CoNLL完成2×2 matrix的最后一角。SJ rho=0.431几乎完美匹配Qwen+CoNLL的0.436，\n      跨model差异仅0.005，是整个paper中最强的model-agnostic evidence。\n      structural beats logprob（0.431 vs 0.307, delta=0.124）跨全部4个NER config一致，\n      实现cross_config_ner_structural_gt_logprob_rate=1.0（100%，best档focal range）。\n      N=16进一步提升到0.464，3-seed SD仅0.007，是所有config中最稳定的。\n      Logprob AUROC=0.761在此config上最高，但这是因为CoNLL greedy F1=0.927已极高，\n      logprob的absolute calibration在easy tasks上较好——这不undermines structural advantage，\n      因为rho仍然structural领先。Reviewer认为此4th cell完成了generalization matrix，\n      结合3-seed robustness满足\"2×2 matrix + 3-seed\"的充分性标准。\n      N=16 3-seed SD=0.007是所有config中最低的，因为CoNLL数据量大（n=2756 valid）\n      使统计估计inherently更stable。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: 2×2 Generalization Matrix (NER, N=8, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Model, Dataset, SJ_ρ, FK_ρ, Logprob_ρ, SJ>Logprob?]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-8B, SciERC, 0.357, 0.265, 0.140, \"✓ (+0.217)\"]\n          - [Qwen3-8B, CoNLL, 0.436, 0.400, 0.316, \"✓ (+0.120)\"]\n          - [LLaMA-3.1-8B, SciERC, 0.363, 0.327, 0.183, \"✓ (+0.180)\"]\n          - [LLaMA-3.1-8B, CoNLL, 0.431, 0.428, 0.307, \"✓ (+0.124)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: 2×2 heatmap of SJ ρ across model × dataset, with SJ-logprob delta annotated in each cell — all positive, all >0.10\"\n    analysis: >\n      2×2 matrix是paper generalization claim的visual anchor。所有4 cells SJ>logprob delta在0.12-0.22范围，\n      覆盖focal_rho_gap [0.15, 0.36]的下部。Reviewer认为这比单一dataset上更大的gap更convincing，\n      因为consistency across settings > magnitude in one setting。\n      best档下这张figure+table直接回应R1(单数据集)+R2(单模型)+R14(cross-model thin)三个concerns。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8223,"cache_read_input_tokens":52708,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8223},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e875990c-d55f-428c-99f3-f4852bff76fa","uuid":"44ed8537-efea-4d27-aaeb-5e8c85b7e8af"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":385613,"duration_api_ms":387164,"num_turns":3,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始3-claim framing完全成立。Claim 1以voting AUROC 0.73 vs logprob 0.56为headline，SJ作为generalizable complement。\n  Claim 2 (correlation-selection gap) 定位为paper最具practical insight的发现——改变practitioners对structured TTS的认知。\n  Claim 3提供explanatory depth。Claims无需调整强度。Quality estimation framing被接受为first-class contribution，\n  correlation-selection gap被视为novel conceptual contribution。2×2 matrix + 3-seed robustness被认为generalization充分。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"baseline_logprob\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-012\"\n    description: \"Compute sequence log-probability for all existing pilot samples (SciERC NER+RE). Correlate log-prob with F1 (ρ, AUROC, τ). Make-or-break: SJ must beat log-prob.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_full_rho_sj: 0.357\n      ner_full_rho_fk: 0.265\n      ner_full_rho_logprob: 0.140\n      ner_full_rho_greedy_logprob: 0.162\n      ner_full_tau_sj: 0.266\n      ner_full_tau_logprob: 0.101\n      ner_full_auroc_sj: 0.689\n      ner_full_auroc_fk: 0.629\n      ner_full_auroc_logprob: 0.591\n      ner_full_n: 529\n      ner_sj_vs_logprob_rho_delta: 0.217\n      ner_sj_vs_logprob_auroc_delta: 0.098\n      re_full_rho_sj: 0.211\n      re_full_rho_fk: 0.253\n      re_full_rho_logprob: 0.247\n      re_full_auroc_sj: 0.592\n      re_full_auroc_fk: 0.626\n      re_full_auroc_logprob: 0.619\n      re_full_n: 397\n      re_cond_rho_sj: 0.368\n      re_cond_rho_fk: 0.317\n      re_cond_rho_logprob: 0.146\n      re_cond_auroc_sj: 0.684\n      re_cond_auroc_logprob: 0.549\n      re_cond_n: 296\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下SJ在NER上以rho +0.217的决定性优势碾压logprob，AUROC差距约+0.10在focal range内（0.10-0.17），\n      确立structural consistency的核心价值。logprob在NER上信号极弱（rho=0.14）是因为fine-tuned模型对NER\n      已充分校准，生成概率无法区分细粒度entity-set质量差异。RE full上logprob略优于SJ（0.247 vs 0.211）\n      不构成问题——反而为Claim 2提供素材：logprob作为per-sample信号在RE上有unique value，而SJ在RE \n      conditional set上以rho=0.368大幅反超logprob 0.146，说明剔除knowledge-gap实例后structural信号恢复。\n      此模式直接支撑correlation-selection gap论点。Reviewer认为NER上SJ vs logprob的差距足够decisive，\n      且logprob在RE conditional的崩溃（0.146）说明它不是万能信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Instance-Level Quality Estimation (SciERC, N=8, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER τ, NER AUROC, RE ρ, RE AUROC, RE_cond ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ, 0.357, 0.266, 0.689, 0.211, 0.592, 0.368]\n          - [FK, 0.265, 0.203, 0.629, 0.253, 0.626, 0.317]\n          - [Logprob, 0.140, 0.101, 0.591, 0.247, 0.619, 0.146]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart comparing AUROC across 3 signals (SJ/FK/logprob) for NER full / RE full / RE cond, highlighting SJ dominance on NER and RE cond\"\n    analysis: >\n      SJ在NER上的AUROC=0.689远超logprob 0.591，差距0.098在best档focal range下限附近。\n      关键在于RE conditional的翻转模式（SJ 0.368 >> logprob 0.146），这为后续correlation-selection gap\n      和task-complexity boundary分析奠定基础。Reviewer认为此对比充分证明structural信号的独立价值，\n      无需依赖selection improvement。\n\n  - name: \"baseline_exact_match\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-013\"\n    description: \"Exact-match voting rate: fraction of N samples producing identical entity/relation sets. Direct analogue of Wang et al. self-consistency.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_full_rho: 0.294\n      ner_full_p: 5.12e-12\n      ner_full_tau: 0.218\n      ner_full_auroc: 0.640\n      re_full_rho: 0.156\n      re_full_p: 0.0018\n      re_full_tau: 0.119\n      re_full_auroc: 0.586\n    result_rationale: >\n      EM作为原始self-consistency（Wang et al. 2023）在structured outputs上的直接类比，\n      预期表现中等：NER rho=0.294介于SJ（0.357）和FK（0.265）之间，RE更弱（0.156）。\n      best档下这个结果完美服务于叙事——EM太粗粒度，无法区分\"几乎正确\"和\"完全错误\"的entity set，\n      因为structured outputs的partial overlap比reasoning的discrete answer空间大得多。\n      这motivate了SJ这类set-aware similarity metric的必要性。Reviewer认为EM baseline充分，\n      证明简单迁移reasoning self-consistency到structured prediction是insufficient的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (EM row)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, NER τ, NER AUROC, RE ρ, RE AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [EM, 0.294, 0.218, 0.640, 0.156, 0.586]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      EM在NER上显著优于random但显著弱于SJ，验证了original self-consistency对structured output的局限性。\n      RE上EM几乎无效（rho=0.156），因为relation triplet的exact match概率极低。\n      best档reviewer将此视为支持SJ设计动机的positive evidence。\n\n  - name: \"baseline_entity_voting\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: \"Entity-level majority voting: count how many of N samples include each entity. Voting confidence as quality estimator.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_full_rho: 0.392\n      ner_full_p: 8.1e-21\n      ner_full_tau: 0.291\n      ner_full_auroc: 0.704\n      re_full_rho: 0.340\n      re_full_p: 3.21e-12\n      re_full_tau: 0.256\n      re_full_auroc: 0.667\n      ner_voting_f1: 0.625\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.648\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.779\n      re_voting_f1: 0.358\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.402\n      re_oracle_f1: 0.589\n    result_rationale: >\n      Voting confidence成为NER上最强单一信号（rho=0.392, AUROC=0.704），略优于SJ（0.357, 0.689）。\n      best档下这不构成对SJ的威胁，反而强化叙事：voting和SJ同属structural consistency family，\n      两者都利用entity-across-sample一致性。Voting更简单（直接计数），SJ更通用（可扩展到任意结构化输出）。\n      关键负面结果：voting作为selection策略（选majority entity构成的答案）F1=0.625 < greedy 0.648。\n      这是correlation-selection gap的首个信号——即使instance-level估计强（AUROC 0.704），\n      也不能直接转化为per-sample selection。best档reviewer将voting+SJ视为互补的structural family成员，\n      而非竞争关系。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (Voting row) + Table 3: Selection F1\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER ρ, AUROC, Selection_F1, vs_Greedy]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting, 0.392, 0.704, 0.625, \"-0.023\"]\n          - [SJ, 0.357, 0.689, \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Voting confidence scatter plot: voting_conf vs instance F1, showing strong positive trend but with high variance at intermediate confidence levels\"\n    analysis: >\n      Voting confidence AUROC=0.704最高，但voting selection F1=0.625 < greedy 0.648的结果是\n      correlation-selection gap的核心evidence。best档reviewer理解这个区别：instance-level质量预测\n      能力不等于per-sample选择能力，因为voting_conf是跨sample的aggregate signal，无法rank同一instance的N个sample。\n\n  - name: \"evaluation_metrics_expansion\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-015\"\n    description: \"Unified 5-signal evaluation with AUROC, τ, ρ, calibration, leave-one-out SJ. All signals × all datasets.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_n_valid: 529\n      ner_n_cond: 501\n      ner_voting_rho_full: 0.502\n      ner_voting_rho_cond: 0.450\n      ner_voting_auroc: 0.728\n      ner_voting_tau: 0.377\n      ner_sj_rho_full: 0.357\n      ner_sj_rho_cond: 0.412\n      ner_sj_auroc: 0.666\n      ner_sj_tau: 0.266\n      ner_em_rho_full: 0.257\n      ner_em_auroc: 0.623\n      ner_fk_rho_full: 0.265\n      ner_fk_auroc: 0.624\n      ner_logprob_rho_full: 0.140\n      ner_logprob_auroc: 0.559\n      re_voting_rho_full: 0.422\n      re_voting_auroc: 0.716\n      re_sj_rho_full: 0.211\n      re_sj_auroc: 0.582\n      re_logprob_rho_full: 0.247\n      re_logprob_auroc: 0.635\n      loo_sj_max_delta_rho: 0.000305\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下统一评估框架确立信号排序的稳健性。NER full ordering: voting(0.502) > SJ(0.357) > FK(0.265) > EM(0.257) > logprob(0.140)，\n      三个独立指标（ρ/τ/AUROC）排序完全一致，消除单一指标cherry-picking的reviewer疑虑。\n      SJ在NER cond上反超voting之外的所有信号（0.412 vs FK 0.306, EM 0.343），说明SJ对\"模型有能力但不确定\"的实例\n      有独特判别力。LOO-SJ与原始SJ差异仅0.0003，彻底消除evaluation circularity质疑。\n      Reviewer认为多指标一致性证明findings robust，LOO check是methodological contribution。\n      Cross-dataset结果（CoNLL AUROC 0.80, LLaMA NER AUROC 0.70+）在later exp-002/007中确认，\n      使structural > logprob rate跨全部NER配置达100%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Unified Quality Estimation (SciERC, N=8, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER_ρ, NER_τ, NER_AUROC, RE_ρ, RE_AUROC, NER_cond_ρ, RE_cond_ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Voting, 0.502, 0.377, 0.728, 0.422, 0.716, 0.450, 0.463]\n          - [SJ, 0.357, 0.266, 0.666, 0.211, 0.582, 0.412, 0.368]\n          - [FK, 0.265, 0.203, 0.624, 0.253, 0.631, 0.306, 0.317]\n          - [EM, 0.257, 0.192, 0.623, 0.100, 0.504, 0.343, 0.361]\n          - [Logprob, 0.140, 0.101, 0.559, 0.247, 0.635, 0.163, 0.146]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Reliability diagram (calibration): 5 signals × NER/RE, showing ECE values and calibration curves\"\n      - \"Multi-metric consistency heatmap: ρ vs τ vs AUROC rankings across signals and settings\"\n    analysis: >\n      5-signal unified evaluation是paper的empirical backbone。best档reviewer看到三个metric方向一致、\n      LOO无circularity、structural family跨NER一致领先，认为evaluation methodology sound。\n      SJ在cond set上的relative strength（超越FK和EM）说明它在\"中间难度\"实例上最有价值——\n      这些正是selective prediction最需要信号的区间。\n\n  - name: \"ner_n16_scierc\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: \"NER N=16 on SciERC with 3 seeds for robustness. Test N-scaling effect.\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_instances: 551\n      ner_n: 529\n      re_n: 397\n      N: 16\n      T: 1.0\n      seed42_ner_sj_rho: 0.398\n      seed42_ner_voting_conf_rho: 0.399\n      seed42_ner_logprob_rho: 0.237\n      seed42_re_sj_rho: 0.277\n      seed42_re_voting_conf_rho: 0.380\n      seed123_ner_sj_rho: 0.424\n      seed123_ner_voting_conf_rho: 0.438\n      seed456_ner_sj_rho: 0.384\n      seed456_ner_voting_conf_rho: 0.411\n      ner_3seed_mean_sj_rho: 0.402\n      ner_3seed_sd_sj_rho: 0.020\n      ner_3seed_mean_voting_rho: 0.416\n      ner_3seed_sd_voting_rho: 0.020\n      n8_to_n16_ner_sj_delta: \"+0.016 to +0.068\"\n      re_3seed_mean_sj_rho: 0.273\n      re_3seed_sd_sj_rho: 0.010\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下N=16实验确认三个关键点：(1) 3-seed NER SJ rho均值0.402±0.020，SD极低，\n      证明结果非随机种子产物。(2) N=8→N=16 SJ rho提升+0.02~0.07，证明N-scaling有正效应\n      但saturating，与structural consistency作为aggregate statistic的理论一致。\n      (3) RE rho仍弱（~0.27），3-seed一致，确认task-complexity boundary是systematic而非noise。\n      Reviewer认为3-seed SD<0.03满足robustness标准，不需要更多种子。\n      N=16的marginal improvement小于N=8→greedy的基础gap，说明信号质量比sample数量更重要。\n      这为\"T=1.0 + N=8 sufficient\"的实践推荐提供依据。RE的persistent weakness被accepted\n      为Claim 3的supporting evidence——compound error使所有信号降级。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: 3-Seed Robustness (SciERC, N=16, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Seed, NER_SJ_ρ, NER_VC_ρ, NER_logprob_ρ, RE_SJ_ρ, RE_VC_ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [42, 0.398, 0.399, 0.237, 0.277, 0.380]\n          - [123, 0.424, 0.438, 0.239, 0.267, 0.370]\n          - [456, 0.384, 0.411, 0.232, 0.268, 0.375]\n          - [\"Mean±SD\", \"0.402±0.020\", \"0.416±0.020\", \"0.236±0.004\", \"0.271±0.006\", \"0.375±0.005\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Error bar plot: 3-seed mean ± SD for each signal on NER vs RE, visualizing stability and NER-RE gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      NER上structural信号跨seed高度稳定（SD≤0.02），logprob更稳定但绝对水平低得多。\n      RE上所有信号一致弱且稳定，排除了单seed-lucky的可能。best档reviewer认为2 models × 2 datasets × 3 seeds\n      的矩阵提供了sufficient generalization evidence。\n\n  - name: \"ner_conll2003\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: \"Fine-tune Qwen3-8B on CoNLL-2003 + NER N=8 inference. Cross-dataset generalization.\"\n    expected_results:\n      dataset: CoNLL-2003\n      model: Qwen3-8B\n      n_instances: 3453\n      n_valid: 2756\n      N: 8\n      T: 1.0\n      greedy_f1: 0.912\n      oracle_f1: 0.954\n      oracle_headroom: 0.042\n      sj_rho_full: 0.436\n      sj_tau_full: 0.385\n      sj_auroc_full: 0.801\n      fk_rho_full: 0.400\n      fk_auroc_full: 0.774\n      logprob_rho_full: 0.316\n      logprob_auroc_full: 0.753\n      em_rho_full: 0.451\n      em_auroc_full: 0.816\n      voting_conf_rho_full: 0.424\n      voting_conf_auroc_full: 0.789\n      sj_vs_logprob_delta_rho: 0.120\n      sj_vs_logprob_ci_significant: true\n      voting_f1: 0.914\n    result_rationale: >\n      CoNLL-2003是标准NER benchmark，模型greedy F1高达0.912（vs SciERC 0.618），oracle headroom仅0.042。\n      best档下这个\"easy dataset\"结果有三重价值：(1) SJ rho=0.436仍然显著优于logprob 0.316（delta=0.120, \n      bootstrap CI不含0），证明structural advantage不是dataset-specific artifact。(2) 所有结构信号\n      的AUROC大幅提升（SJ 0.80 vs SciERC 0.69），因为高accuracy regime下质量估计更容易——\n      这与Claim 3 task-complexity boundary方向一致。(3) EM在CoNLL上异常强（0.451, AUROC 0.816），\n      因为简单NER的entity set更容易exact match，但这只说明EM适合easy tasks，而SJ在hard tasks上优势更大。\n      Oracle headroom仅4.2pp说明NER few-shot已接近天花板，selection改进空间极小，\n      进一步支持\"quality estimation比selection更有实际价值\"的framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Cross-Dataset Generalization (CoNLL-2003, Qwen3-8B, N=8)\"\n        columns: [Signal, ρ, τ, AUROC]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ, 0.436, 0.385, 0.801]\n          - [FK, 0.400, 0.357, 0.774]\n          - [EM, 0.451, 0.400, 0.816]\n          - [Voting, 0.424, 0.378, 0.789]\n          - [Logprob, 0.316, 0.247, 0.753]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: SciERC vs CoNLL AUROC comparison for each signal, showing consistent structural > logprob pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      CoNLL上SJ AUROC 0.80是全实验最高，强化cross-dataset generalization。EM在easy dataset上反超SJ\n      不影响叙事，因为(a) SJ仍然beat logprob，(b) EM无法推广到RE/event等非entity任务。\n      Reviewer认为SciERC(hard)+CoNLL(easy)的覆盖足够，加上LLaMA验证构成2×2 matrix。\n\n  - name: \"ner_wnut17\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: \"WNUT-17 social media NER. Expected negative — noisy domain stress test.\"\n    expected_results:\n      dataset: WNUT-17\n      model: Qwen3-8B\n      n_instances: 1287\n      n_gold_empty: 598\n      N: 16\n      T: 1.0\n      greedy_f1: 0.523\n      oracle_f1: 0.664\n      headroom: 0.141\n      rho_sj_full: 0.082\n      rho_fk_full: 0.124\n      rho_logprob_full: -0.414\n      rho_sj_cond: 0.275\n      rho_fk_cond: 0.164\n      rho_logprob_cond: 0.352\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 53.7\n      status: orphaned\n    result_rationale: >\n      WNUT-17预期且确认为negative：>50% samples F1=0说明模型对social media domain能力不足，\n      54%的gold empty instances进一步扭曲分布。SJ rho_full仅0.082（not significant），\n      logprob甚至负相关（-0.414，因为模型对不熟悉的domain overconfident）。\n      best档下此结果被orphaned但不浪费——它为Claim 3提供boundary evidence：当模型base capability不足时\n      （greedy F1仅0.523），所有consistency信号都失效。这与Claim 3的\"capability range\"概念一致。\n      Reviewer不会质疑为什么不include WNUT，因为paper已有2 NER datasets + 2 models = 4 configs，\n      WNUT在Limitations中简要提及作为\"informal text domain remains open challenge\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Orphaned但有分析价值。logprob负相关是striking finding——可在Claim 3讨论中作为\n      \"模型校准在OOD域崩溃\"的evidence一句话提及。不单独成table/figure。\n\n  - name: \"re_diagnostic_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: \"Per-relation-type consistency breakdown, error propagation analysis, bootstrap CI, threshold sensitivity.\"\n    expected_results:\n      per_relation_rho_range: \"FEATURE-OF ρ≈0.004 (worst) to HYPONYM-OF ρ≈0.545 (best)\"\n      feature_of_rho_sj: 0.004\n      feature_of_n: 50\n      feature_of_mean_f1: 0.254\n      hyponym_of_rho_sj: 0.545\n      hyponym_of_n: 36\n      conjunction_rho_vc: 0.484\n      used_for_rho_vc: 0.286\n      error_propagation_tail_pct: 21.9\n      error_propagation_head_pct: 17.7\n      error_propagation_head_tail_pct: 15.9\n      error_propagation_type_pct: 8.3\n      span_errors_total_pct: 55.5\n      bootstrap_ci_ner_sj: [0.295, 0.459]\n      bootstrap_ci_re_sj: [0.142, 0.339]\n      fisher_z_ner_vs_re_sj_p: 0.021\n      fisher_z_ner_vs_re_sj_significant: true\n      threshold_sensitivity_thr0_rho_sj: 0.316\n      threshold_sensitivity_thr0_n: 313\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下RE diagnostic提供Claim 3的核心mechanistic evidence。FEATURE-OF rho≈0跨所有信号\n      说明某些relation types对模型而言fundamentally intractable（F1=0.254），而非SJ的问题。\n      Entity span errors占RE FN的55.5%说明error propagation的主因是upstream NER错误，\n      非relation classification本身。Fisher z检验p=0.021确认NER-RE rho差异统计显著。\n      Bootstrap CI不含0确认所有rho estimates reliable。Threshold sensitivity分析显示conditional\n      filtering（排除F1=0实例）稳定提升rho但对阈值选择不过度敏感。\n      Reviewer认为this diagnostic depth将本文从\"SJ works/doesn't work\"提升到\"我们理解为什么\"，\n      是从empirical paper到analytical contribution的关键升级。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Per-Relation-Type Consistency (SciERC RE)\"\n        columns: [Relation, n, Mean_F1, ρ_SJ, ρ_FK, ρ_VC]\n        rows:\n          - [HYPONYM-OF, 36, 0.513, 0.545, 0.646, 0.628]\n          - [CONJUNCTION, 86, 0.480, 0.383, 0.350, 0.484]\n          - [USED-FOR, 299, 0.422, 0.236, 0.255, 0.286]\n          - [PART-OF, 44, 0.297, 0.239, 0.348, 0.283]\n          - [EVALUATE-FOR, 62, 0.365, 0.172, 0.255, 0.226]\n          - [COMPARE, 35, 0.453, 0.168, 0.184, 0.180]\n          - [FEATURE-OF, 50, 0.254, 0.004, 0.052, 0.014]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Error propagation Sankey diagram: RE FN breakdown by error type (head/tail/type/combined)\"\n      - \"Scatter: per-relation mean_F1 vs rho_sj, showing positive correlation with FEATURE-OF as outlier\"\n    analysis: >\n      FEATURE-OF的near-zero rho跨所有信号是强evidence：问题不在SJ而在task本身。\n      Span error占55.5% FN直接支撑compound error propagation narrative。\n      best档reviewer视此分析为paper的analytical contribution之一——不仅报告what works，\n      还解释why with mechanistic granularity。\n\n  - name: \"temperature_sensitivity_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: \"T=0.7 vs T=1.0 comparison on NER+RE for all signals. Signal-noise tradeoff.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_sj_rho_t10: 0.383\n      ner_sj_rho_t07: 0.388\n      ner_sj_delta: 0.005\n      ner_fk_rho_t10: 0.259\n      ner_fk_rho_t07: 0.321\n      ner_fk_delta: 0.062\n      re_sj_rho_t10: 0.244\n      re_sj_rho_t07: 0.234\n      re_sj_delta: -0.010\n      sj_temperature_robustness: \"Δρ=±0.01\"\n      fk_temperature_sensitivity: \"Δρ=±0.06-0.09\"\n      oracle_headroom_t10_re: 0.167\n      oracle_headroom_t07_re: 0.131\n      diversity_1_sj_t10: 0.389\n      diversity_1_sj_t07: 0.313\n      recommendation: \"T=1.0 + conditional filtering > temperature optimization\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下temperature分析揭示SJ的关键优势：温度鲁棒性。SJ Δρ=±0.01说明SJ对sampling \n      temperature几乎不敏感，而FK在T=0.7和T=1.0之间变化高达Δρ=±0.06-0.09。\n      这是因为SJ度量entity-set级别的结构相似性，对surface text变异（temperature控制的主要效应）\n      天然不敏感。T=1.0保留更多oracle headroom（RE: 0.167 vs 0.131）和diversity（1-SJ: 0.389 vs 0.313），\n      说明higher temperature虽然引入更多noise但也保留更多potential for improvement。\n      这为\"T=1.0 + conditional filtering\"的实践推荐提供依据：与其精调temperature，不如用structural \n      signal做post-hoc filtering。best档reviewer认为temperature robustness是SJ的practical advantage，\n      降低practitioners的hyperparameter tuning burden。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Temperature Sensitivity (SciERC, N=8)\"\n        columns: [Signal, NER_ρ_T07, NER_ρ_T10, Δ, RE_ρ_T07, RE_ρ_T10, Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [SJ, 0.388, 0.383, \"+0.005\", 0.234, 0.244, \"-0.010\"]\n          - [FK, 0.321, 0.259, \"+0.062\", 0.184, 0.278, \"-0.094\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: ρ vs temperature for each signal, showing SJ flat line vs FK's temperature dependence\"\n    analysis: >\n      SJ的temperature robustness (Δρ≤0.01) vs FK的sensitivity (Δρ≈0.06-0.09)是paper的practical insight。\n      Conditional filtering >> temperature tuning的finding简化了practitioners的决策——\n      不需要搜索最优temperature，用T=1.0+SJ filtering即可。\n\n  - name: \"adaptive_compute_demo\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: \"Best-of-N selection across all datasets: SJ vs logprob vs FK vs EM vs voting vs random vs greedy.\"\n    expected_results:\n      ner_scierc_s42_greedy: 0.618\n      ner_scierc_s42_oracle: 0.787\n      ner_scierc_s42_sj: 0.620\n      ner_scierc_s42_logprob: 0.621\n      ner_scierc_s42_fk: 0.621\n      ner_scierc_s42_em: 0.606\n      ner_scierc_s42_voting: 0.585\n      ner_scierc_s42_random: 0.586\n      ner_conll_greedy: 0.725\n      ner_conll_oracle: 0.757\n      ner_conll_sj: 0.718\n      ner_conll_logprob: 0.716\n      re_scierc_greedy: 0.403\n      re_scierc_oracle: 0.631\n      re_scierc_logprob: 0.410\n      re_scierc_sj: 0.397\n      re_scierc_voting: 0.408\n      re_scierc_random: 0.364\n      ner_any_signal_beats_greedy: false\n      re_logprob_beats_greedy: true\n      re_logprob_vs_greedy_delta: \"+0.007 to +0.024\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下这是Claim 2 correlation-selection gap的决定性evidence。NER上所有信号均未超greedy：\n      SJ 0.620 ≈ logprob 0.621 ≈ FK 0.621 ≈ greedy 0.618（差异在noise范围内），而oracle 0.787\n      说明headroom巨大（+16.9pp）但当前信号无法exploit。RE上唯一logprob以+2.4pp超greedy，\n      其他信号均失败。best档reviewer理解这个negative result的novelty：(1)它推翻了从reasoning \n      self-consistency类推到structured prediction的naive expectation，(2)它精确定位了gap的来源——\n      consistency signals是instance-level aggregates（一个score per input），不能rank同一instance的\n      N个outputs，而logprob是唯一的per-sample signal。(3) oracle headroom的存在证明information\n      exists in the samples，只是当前unsupervised信号无法access它。\n      CoNLL上NER所有信号均弱于greedy（0.714-0.718 vs 0.725），因为easy task的oracle headroom仅3.2pp，\n      greedy已接近最优。这进一步支持\"NER quality estimation > selection\"的framing。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Best-of-N Selection F1\"\n        columns: [Config, Greedy, Oracle, SJ, Logprob, FK, Voting, Random]\n        rows:\n          - [\"NER SciERC\", 0.618, 0.787, 0.620, 0.621, 0.621, 0.585, 0.586]\n          - [\"NER CoNLL\", 0.725, 0.757, 0.718, 0.716, 0.717, 0.714, 0.692]\n          - [\"RE SciERC\", 0.403, 0.631, 0.397, 0.410, 0.396, 0.408, 0.364]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1 (paper highlight): Selection F1 bar chart with greedy baseline line and oracle ceiling, showing ALL signals clustered near greedy on NER while oracle is far above — the visual gap IS the contribution\"\n    analysis: >\n      这张figure是paper最重要的可视化——greedy line、signal cluster、oracle ceiling之间的巨大空白区域\n      直观展示correlation-selection gap。best档reviewer被这个visualization convinced，\n      认为这是paper最novel的finding。RE logprob +2.4pp是唯一positive selection result，\n      对应logprob作为per-sample信号的unique property。\n\n  - name: \"ner_multi_model\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B on SciERC. Cross-model validation for model-agnostic claim.\"\n    expected_results:\n      model: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct\"\n      dataset: SciERC\n      N: 8\n      T: 1.0\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.660\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.781\n      ner_headroom: 0.121\n      ner_rho_sj: 0.363\n      ner_rho_fk: 0.327\n      ner_rho_logprob: 0.183\n      ner_structural_beats_surface: true\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.434\n      re_oracle_f1: 0.568\n      re_rho_sj: 0.299\n      re_rho_fk: 0.305\n      re_rho_logprob: 0.288\n      re_structural_beats_surface: false\n      re_cond_rho_sj: 0.405\n      re_cond_rho_logprob: 0.092\n      sample_f1_pct_zero_re: 41.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下LLaMA验证了findings的model-agnostic性。NER上SJ rho=0.363与Qwen的0.357几乎一致，\n      structural beats surface holds（SJ > FK > logprob），说明structural consistency advantage\n      不是Qwen architecture/training的artifact。LLaMA logprob在NER上更弱（0.183 vs Qwen 0.140），\n      可能因为LLaMA的logprob calibration不同。RE上SJ full rho=0.299依然弱，但RE cond上SJ=0.405\n      远超logprob 0.092，模式与Qwen完全一致。RE cond上logprob的崩溃（0.092）跨model一致，\n      强化Claim 2中\"logprob在conditional set失效\"的finding。\n      RE structural_beats_surface=false是expected——在RE full上FK和logprob略优于SJ，\n      但paper的claim是NER上structural beats logprob（100% configs），RE上用于diagnostic analysis。\n      3-seed LLaMA验证（seed 42/123/456）显示NER SJ rho SD~0.05，虽然比Qwen变异略大但方向一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Cross-Model Validation (LLaMA-3.1-8B, SciERC)\"\n        columns: [Subtask, SJ_ρ, FK_ρ, Logprob_ρ, Struct>Surface?]\n        rows:\n          - [NER full, 0.363, 0.327, 0.183, \"✓\"]\n          - [NER cond, 0.311, 0.226, 0.109, \"✓\"]\n          - [RE full, 0.299, 0.305, 0.288, \"✗\"]\n          - [RE cond, 0.405, 0.259, 0.092, \"✓\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Qwen vs LLaMA paired bar chart for NER rho: shows near-identical structural > logprob pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA结果是2×2 matrix的关键一角。NER上Qwen SJ=0.357, LLaMA SJ=0.363几乎不可区分，\n      而logprob差异更大（0.140 vs 0.183），说明structural signals比model-specific signals更stable across architectures。\n      best档reviewer认为2 models sufficient for model-agnostic claim at 8B scale level。\n\n  - name: \"re_n16_confirmation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: \"RE N=16 on SciERC to confirm negative finding with higher statistical power.\"\n    expected_results:\n      N: 16\n      re_greedy_f1: 0.434\n      re_oracle_f1: 0.666\n      re_headroom: 0.232\n      re_rho_sj_full: 0.297\n      re_rho_fk_full: 0.287\n      re_rho_logprob_full: 0.299\n      re_rho_sj_cond: 0.398\n      re_rho_fk_cond: 0.377\n      re_rho_logprob_cond: 0.275\n      ner_rho_sj_full: 0.377\n      ner_greedy_f1: 0.664\n      ner_oracle_f1: 0.821\n      ner_headroom: 0.157\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下N=16 RE确认了RE full rho的persistent weakness：SJ rho=0.297即使sample翻倍也未达0.40。\n      这排除了\"N=8 sample budget不够\"的alternative explanation——问题是compound error propagation\n      带来的fundamental noise floor。同时oracle headroom从N=8的0.167扩大到N=16的0.232，\n      说明更多samples确实提供更多diversity，但没有unsupervised signal能exploit。\n      NER上N=16 SJ rho=0.377略低于N=8的0.398，可能是random variation（在bootstrap CI内），\n      说明NER信号已在N=8 saturated。\n      Reviewer认为RE N=16 negative result不是weakness——它strengthens Claim 3 by ruling out\n      sample budget as the sole explanation for RE weakness。Problem is more fundamental than N。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4 (N=16 row)\"\n        columns: [Config, N, SJ_ρ, FK_ρ, Logprob_ρ, SJ_cond_ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [\"RE N=8\", 8, 0.211, 0.253, 0.247, 0.368]\n          - [\"RE N=16\", 16, 0.297, 0.287, 0.299, 0.398]\n          - [\"NER N=8\", 8, 0.357, 0.265, 0.140, 0.412]\n          - [\"NER N=16\", 16, 0.377, 0.251, 0.315, 0.360]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      N=16 RE结果是nuanced的：rho从0.211提升到0.297（+0.086），说明更多samples有帮助，\n      但未达到NER的水平。Cond set上RE N=16 SJ=0.398接近threshold，说明compound error的影响\n      可以被conditional filtering部分缓解。best档下这被视为Claim 3的refined evidence。\n\n  - name: \"capability_stratification\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: \"Stratify instances by difficulty (greedy F1, sentence length, entity count). Test inverted-U hypothesis.\"\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_sj_rho_overall: 0.398\n      ner_by_ent_count_0_sj_rho: 0.689\n      ner_by_ent_count_1_2_sj_rho: 0.415\n      ner_by_ent_count_3_5_sj_rho: 0.353\n      ner_by_ent_count_6plus_sj_rho: 0.547\n      ner_by_sent_len_Q1_sj_rho: 0.461\n      ner_by_sent_len_Q4_sj_rho: 0.382\n      re_by_greedy_f1_hard_sj_rho: -0.043\n      re_by_greedy_f1_easy_sj_rho: 0.210\n      proxy_independence_f1_vs_slen: -0.021\n      proxy_independence_f1_vs_ecnt: 0.007\n      inverted_u_confirmed: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下capability stratification提供了两个insights：(1) inverted-U pattern NOT confirmed——\n      SJ rho在independent proxies（sentence length, entity count）上没有呈现clean的先升后降模式，\n      而是较为平坦或单调。这是honest reporting，避免overclaiming。(2) 但entity count=0（无entity的句子）\n      上SJ rho=0.689异常高，说明\"空集\"的consistency极强（所有samples都predict nothing或全predict something）。\n      RE hard instances（greedy F1<0.25）上SJ rho=-0.043（无信号甚至轻微反向），vs easy上0.210，\n      支持\"模型能力范围之外consistency失效\"的narrative。\n      Reviewer认为honest reporting of non-confirmation是methodological strength，\n      不overclaim inverted-U但保留entity-count和difficulty-stratified分析的解释价值。\n      Independent proxy analysis（sentence length与F1相关性仅-0.021）证明stratification variable\n      不是F1的proxy，避免circular reasoning。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Stratified ρ by Entity Count (SciERC NER)\"\n        columns: [Entity_Count, n, SJ_ρ, FK_ρ, Logprob_ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0\", \"~40\", 0.689, 0.550, 0.400]\n          - [\"1-2\", \"~180\", 0.415, 0.310, 0.220]\n          - [\"3-5\", \"~220\", 0.353, 0.260, 0.170]\n          - [\"6+\", \"~90\", 0.547, 0.380, 0.280]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: signal ρ across entity_count × subtask (NER/RE), showing gradient from high to low\"\n    analysis: >\n      Entity count=0和6+的高rho形成U-shape（非inverted-U），可解释为：空集高consensus + \n      丰entity instances上structural signals有更多\"evidence\"用于比较。\n      RE hard上的near-zero/negative rho是Claim 3的strongest evidence point。\n\n  - name: \"selection_curves\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-010\"\n    description: \"Best-of-N selection curves for N=1,2,4,8,16. Visualization for paper figures.\"\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_ner_greedy: 0.618\n      scierc_ner_n4_sj: 0.607\n      scierc_ner_n4_logprob: 0.616\n      scierc_ner_n8_sj: 0.614\n      scierc_ner_n8_logprob: 0.619\n      scierc_ner_n16_sj: 0.620\n      scierc_ner_n16_logprob: 0.621\n      scierc_ner_n16_oracle: 0.787\n      scierc_re_greedy: 0.403\n      scierc_re_n8_logprob: 0.413\n      scierc_re_n16_logprob: 0.410\n      scierc_re_n16_oracle: 0.631\n      conll_ner_greedy: 0.725\n      conll_ner_n8_sj: 0.718\n      conll_ner_n8_oracle: 0.757\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下selection curves的核心价值在可视化——figure展示所有信号的F1曲线随N增长几乎平坦\n      （紧贴greedy baseline），而oracle曲线陡升。NER上N=4→8→16的SJ selection F1仅从0.607→0.614→0.620，\n      vs oracle从0.714→0.752→0.787。这个visual gap是paper最有冲击力的figure。\n      RE上logprob曲线微升（到0.413 at N=8），是唯一visible improvement。\n      CoNLL上所有曲线都在更高F1区间但同样flat（signals 0.714-0.718 vs oracle 0.757）。\n      Reviewer认为这张图比任何table都更直观地传达correlation-selection gap——\n      \"the whitespace between signal lines and oracle IS the gap\"。\n      此figure directly addresses R16 (\"zero figures\")。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: Selection curves — F1 vs N for each signal + oracle ceiling + greedy baseline. Three panels: SciERC NER, SciERC RE, CoNLL NER. Signal lines flat near greedy, oracle rises — visual gap is the contribution\"\n      - \"Inset annotation: oracle headroom percentage at N=16 (NER +16.9pp, RE +22.8pp) vs best signal improvement (NER +0.3pp, RE +0.7pp)\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是paper必须有的figure，直接回应R16。best档reviewer被visual gap convinced，\n      认为一图胜千言——不需要读table就能理解correlation-selection gap的magnitude。\n      Oracle的steep rise vs signals的flat lines是non-trivial finding，因为naive expectation\n      是\"more samples + better ranking = better output\"。\n\n  - name: \"ner_ood_robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-011\"\n    description: \"OOD robustness: test NER consistency signal on cross-domain transfer.\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"planned (not executed)\"\n      hypothetical_ner_ood_sj_rho: 0.15-0.25\n      hypothetical_fk_rho: 0.10-0.18\n      hypothetical_logprob_rho: 0.05-0.15\n      structural_still_beats_surface: true\n      absolute_performance_degraded: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下exp-011未执行，因为(1)依赖已orphaned的exp-003 WNUT数据，(2) priority P2且\n      paper已有2 datasets × 2 models = 4 NER configs的sufficient coverage。\n      如果执行，预期OOD domain上所有信号大幅退化但structural仍优于surface——\n      因为OOD下entity set的partial overlap仍比exact match更informative。\n      Logprob在OOD上可能overconfident（如WNUT所示负相关），使structural advantage更大。\n      best档reviewer不会因缺少此实验扣分——paper在Limitations中承认\"informal text domains \n      not covered\"已sufficient。OOD robustness是natural future work方向。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Not executed, acknowledged in Limitations. best档下此gap不影响acceptance，\n      因为2×2 matrix + 3-seed在formal text domains（scientific + news）上已sufficient。\n      OOD robustness与Claim 3的boundary condition narrative一致——\n      可在Discussion中hypothesize模型capability不足时所有signals degrade。\n\n  - name: \"signal_ensemble_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-016\"\n    description: \"SJ+logprob ensemble: correlation analysis, grid search linear combination, logistic regression, best-of-N selection.\"\n    expected_results:\n      sj_logprob_pearson_ner: 0.57\n      sj_logprob_pearson_re: 0.42\n      best_linear_ner_combo: \"SJ+voting_conf\"\n      best_linear_ner_alpha: 0.3\n      best_linear_ner_rho: 0.489\n      best_linear_re_combo: \"voting_conf+logprob\"\n      best_linear_re_alpha: 0.6\n      best_linear_re_rho: 0.429\n      ensemble_ner_auroc: 0.735\n      ensemble_re_auroc: 0.719\n      best_single_ner_auroc: 0.700\n      best_single_re_auroc: 0.721\n      ensemble_ner_auroc_delta: \"+0.035\"\n      ensemble_re_auroc_delta: \"-0.002\"\n      fk_logistic_coefficient: \"negative\"\n      selection_f1_ner_greedy: 0.609\n      selection_f1_ner_logprob: 0.609\n      selection_f1_ner_ensemble: 0.604\n      selection_f1_ner_oracle: 0.769\n      selection_f1_re_logprob: 0.397\n      selection_f1_re_greedy: 0.374\n      selection_f1_re_ensemble: 0.367\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下ensemble分析回应了Dream 2两位reviewer的independent flag（R11）。\n      SJ和logprob的Pearson correlation 0.57（NER）说明两者partially redundant但非identical——\n      structural consistency和model confidence捕捉不同维度的quality information。\n      最优linear组合是SJ+voting_conf（α=0.3）而非SJ+logprob，说明structural family内部互补\n      优于structural+model-confidence组合。NER ensemble AUROC=0.735比best single 0.700提升+3.5pp，\n      但RE上ensemble无改进（0.719 vs 0.721），因为RE上信号本身太弱，组合也无法rescue。\n      FK在logistic regression中系数为负——surface agreement在structural+model signals存在时\n      是net-negative，可能因为FK的noise（对token-level variation过度敏感）干扰了其他信号。\n      Selection F1上ensemble仍然不超greedy（NER 0.604 < 0.609），再次确认correlation-selection gap。\n      Reviewer认为ensemble分析thorough且conclusions honest：ensemble有marginal value for quality estimation\n      但不改变selection picture。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Ensemble Analysis\"\n        columns: [Method, NER_ρ, NER_AUROC, RE_ρ, RE_AUROC, NER_Sel_F1]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Best single (voting)\", 0.502, 0.700, 0.422, 0.721, 0.596]\n          - [\"SJ+VC α=0.3\", 0.489, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Logistic 5-signal\", \"—\", 0.735, \"—\", 0.719, 0.604]\n          - [\"Greedy\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", 0.609]\n          - [\"Oracle\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", 0.769]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: SJ vs logprob per-instance with Pearson r annotation, colored by F1 quartile — showing partial redundancy\"\n      - \"Alpha sweep line plot: ρ vs α for SJ+VC and SJ+logprob combinations on NER and RE\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ensemble的marginal-but-real improvement on NER quality estimation (+3.5pp AUROC)\n      和zero improvement on selection是best档的核心insight reprise。\n      FK negative coefficient是actionable finding——practitioners应drop FK when structural signals available。\n      SJ+VC > SJ+logprob说明structural family内部互补性强于cross-family组合。\n\n  - name: \"ner_llama_conll\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-017\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B on CoNLL-2003. Completes 2×2 matrix (Qwen×LLaMA × SciERC×CoNLL).\"\n    expected_results:\n      model: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\"\n      dataset: CoNLL-2003\n      N: 8\n      T: 1.0\n      n_instances: 3453\n      n_valid: 2756\n      greedy_f1: 0.927\n      oracle_f1: 0.944\n      oracle_headroom: 0.018\n      full_sj_rho: 0.431\n      full_fk_rho: 0.428\n      full_logprob_rho: 0.307\n      full_em_rho: 0.431\n      full_voting_conf_rho: 0.426\n      full_sj_auroc: 0.704\n      full_logprob_auroc: 0.761\n      cond_sj_rho: 0.436\n      cond_logprob_rho: 0.328\n      sj_vs_logprob_delta: 0.124\n      structural_beats_logprob_rho: true\n      n16_sj_rho: 0.464\n      n16_3seed_mean_sj_rho: 0.463\n      n16_3seed_sd_sj_rho: 0.007\n    result_rationale: >\n      best档下LLaMA+CoNLL完成2×2 matrix的最后一角。SJ rho=0.431几乎完美匹配Qwen+CoNLL的0.436，\n      跨model差异仅0.005，是整个paper中最强的model-agnostic evidence。\n      structural beats logprob（0.431 vs 0.307, delta=0.124）跨全部4个NER config一致，\n      实现cross_config_ner_structural_gt_logprob_rate=1.0（100%，best档focal range）。\n      N=16进一步提升到0.464，3-seed SD仅0.007，是所有config中最稳定的。\n      Logprob AUROC=0.761在此config上最高，但这是因为CoNLL greedy F1=0.927已极高，\n      logprob的absolute calibration在easy tasks上较好——这不undermines structural advantage，\n      因为rho仍然structural领先。Reviewer认为此4th cell完成了generalization matrix，\n      结合3-seed robustness满足\"2×2 matrix + 3-seed\"的充分性标准。\n      N=16 3-seed SD=0.007是所有config中最低的，因为CoNLL数据量大（n=2756 valid）\n      使统计估计inherently更stable。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: 2×2 Generalization Matrix (NER, N=8, T=1.0)\"\n        columns: [Model, Dataset, SJ_ρ, FK_ρ, Logprob_ρ, SJ>Logprob?]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-8B, SciERC, 0.357, 0.265, 0.140, \"✓ (+0.217)\"]\n          - [Qwen3-8B, CoNLL, 0.436, 0.400, 0.316, \"✓ (+0.120)\"]\n          - [LLaMA-3.1-8B, SciERC, 0.363, 0.327, 0.183, \"✓ (+0.180)\"]\n          - [LLaMA-3.1-8B, CoNLL, 0.431, 0.428, 0.307, \"✓ (+0.124)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: 2×2 heatmap of SJ ρ across model × dataset, with SJ-logprob delta annotated in each cell — all positive, all >0.10\"\n    analysis: >\n      2×2 matrix是paper generalization claim的visual anchor。所有4 cells SJ>logprob delta在0.12-0.22范围，\n      覆盖focal_rho_gap [0.15, 0.36]的下部。Reviewer认为这比单一dataset上更大的gap更convincing，\n      因为consistency across settings > magnitude in one setting。\n      best档下这张figure+table直接回应R1(单数据集)+R2(单模型)+R14(cross-model thin)三个concerns。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e875990c-d55f-428c-99f3-f4852bff76fa","total_cost_usd":0.8735139999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49090,"cache_read_input_tokens":116959,"output_tokens":18904,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49090,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":18563,"cache_read_input_tokens":52708,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8223,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8223},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":35522,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.035601999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":18904,"cacheReadInputTokens":116959,"cacheCreationInputTokens":49090,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8379119999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"29f6e3e1-9075-4274-91ac-eca6d8e383e9"}
